  "description": "A true mixte frame with the double top tube/stays. Obviously offers lots of standover height and style as well. You’ll find the geometry is more sporty, than upright-comfy. Though it can be built up to suit either demeanor. Drop bars? Sure. Upright city bars? Of course.\n\nThe upgrade to fitting disc brakes opens this mixte to fitting many different widths of tires, so instead of being limited to 700c x 32mm road tires, you can experiment with a variety of gravel and touring tires as well.\n\nRack and fender eyelets\n\nFits 1-1/8″ (EC34) external cup headset\n\n42, 50, 54, 58, 62cm (Center to top of seat collar)\n\nCompatible with downtube shifters (covers not included for bosses)",
